# `/credits` while a turn is still streaming (slow-turns.json: a chunk every
# 250 ms, the stream held after its tenth until `during` is taken): `during`
# is the screen a second after it was run, with the turn still going; `after`
# once the turn has ended.
credits credits-ok.json
